### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@example.com",
  "password": "SuperSecurePass123!",
  "workspaceName": "Acme"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@example.com",
  "password": "SuperSecurePass123!"
}

### Refresh
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "<refresh-token>"
}

### List Workspaces
GET http://localhost:8080/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>

### Create Project
POST http://localhost:8080/projects?workspaceId=<workspace-id>
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo",
  "description": "Project description"
}

### Create API Key
POST http://localhost:8080/api-keys?workspaceId=<workspace-id>
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Server integration"
}

### Invite User
POST http://localhost:8080/invitations?workspaceId=<workspace-id>
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teammate@example.com",
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

### Accept Invitation
POST http://localhost:8080/invitations/accept
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "<invite-token>",
  "email": "teammate@example.com"
}
